<title>AUSTRIA: Austria's EVN controls Burgenland Holding.</title>
<headline>Austria's EVN controls Burgenland Holding.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's biggest regional utility Energie-Versorgung Niederoesterreich AG (EVN) said on Monday it had raised its stake in Burgenland provincial energy company Burgenland Holding to over 50 percent.</p>
<p>EVN, based in Lower Austria, gave no further details in a statement to the Vienna stock exchange. -- Vienna newsroom +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
